Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,First Episode\NThe Princess Knight\NThe Prince & the Angel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is there a kid around here with blue eyes who looks like a boy or a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, there's no weird kid like that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanabun-chan, isn't there a girl in this town with black hair who looks like a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me, I've never seen one. Well, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What a letdown...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for 12 years already...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they just wanted to know if you're a guy or a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.20,0:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who hired you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If this water touches you, men will turn blue and women will turn purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Up we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, once we start, get off your lazy ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one should I pick... This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you chase after me, it's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, wake up. It is time to awaken. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a waste of 30 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke up well before the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ideally, you would stop this useless foolishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Your Highness, please change into these.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you holding? I'm not the one wearing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness—!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Get my clothes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way better than these flashy, glittery clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Dedicated to the everlasting prosperity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,of His Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Majesty the Queen, and the royal family for thousands of generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we sincerely pray for your ever-flourishing welcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Announcing the arrival of Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deeply honored to behold your gracious presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is wonderful to see you in good health as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What an over-the-top greeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Your Majesty, regarding the usual deer hunt tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,this year we plan to make it even grander and more extravagant...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we even have the money for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry, we'll squeeze plenty of taxes out of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Press it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the army afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me... Good morning, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off your hat indoors!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is with that outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel any shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel so much more comfortable in these clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are the prince of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince must show more dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hardly normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to your carelessness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what am I supposed to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, honorable Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Lord Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That bratty prince, what a damn nuisance he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.03,0:07:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He intentionally tried to get in the way of me stamping the seal...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire won't be able to act so high and mighty for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it is revealed that the prince is actually a woman, the throne cannot be inherited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, by the laws of this kingdom, only a man can ascend to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the secret is exposed, this country will belong to the Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That prince is quite a handful. Don't lower your guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rule 1: The king must not yawn in front of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hiccups and burps are completely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rule: The king must rarely laugh in front of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rule: The king must not fetch things himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He should have his retainers fetch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading mangas again, I see. That simply won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was about Your Highness's age, I read much, much better books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.32,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,About this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more... Your Highness, please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.05,0:08:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where are you going in the middle of your studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, return to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate studying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is full of nothing but old people. I feel like I'm suffocating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what on earth are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, poor child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.57,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that she grew up like that is all because of the laws of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When that child was born, it was right around the time these flowers were blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,People of the kingdom, rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An heir has been born!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.17,0:09:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A prince has been born!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deceiving my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though a princess was born, I declared her to be a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Your Majesty, under the laws of our country, a princess cannot ascend to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we had to present her as a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You announced her as a boy even though she is a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were discovered that she is a princess, it would be disastrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That treacherous Grand Duke Duralumin would seize the opportunity to take over the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Grand Duke Duralumin has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He is right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, oh dear, what shall we do? The preparations...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The time was set, wasn't it? Hurry, the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out some boys' toys—that way we can deceive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,May you grow up healthy and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That was how they managed to fool the Grand Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but ever since then, Sapphire was raised as a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The only ones who knew the secret were the Doctor, the Nanny, and the Chamberlain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve years have passed since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret was strictly kept.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to protect that secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.11,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire always had to be raised as a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, Sapphire has become completely a boy, body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Without ever knowing the joys or happiness of being a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,all for the law of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I feel like I'm going mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Your Highness, taking a walk all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cold response.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was hoping Your Highness might give me a lesson in swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am deeply honored!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me with all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may, excuse me, but the fruit from that tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As for embroidery practice, whoever finishes this beautiful, beautiful embroidery first wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How could a prince like me do an imitation of a girl like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nylon, you were the one who sent an assassin after me the other day, weren't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know nothing of such a— Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever lay a hand on me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange name!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for you for 12 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.91,0:13:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am NOT a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a former angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I came down from heaven, looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sent from heaven to change you back into the gentle girl you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Make ME into a girly girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never become anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure a gentle girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.83,0:15:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And you still dare call yourselves top-tier hitmen employed by Lord Nylon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting thrown into the river by a little brat like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you get tossed in too, Lord Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,IDIOTS!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,After going to all the trouble of buying that potion to tell men and women apart...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,from Ponko the apothecary and lacing your sword with it, you didn't even use it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I tried it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nylon is a man after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nylon, it's Ponko the apothecary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.82,0:15:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, apothecary, I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, is that medicine ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone drinks this, will they blab out the secrets of their heart over and over again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail this time, it's off with your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you, lure the prince out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lure him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:15:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Pathless Forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Entice him into the Pathless Forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There are man-eating wolves in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lure Sapphire over there, he certainly won't come back in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if he does come back, before that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set this potion out and make him drink it first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling that idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, is it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Or this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clumsy fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wandered into quite a dangerous place...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It is I, Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Grand Duke, do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have obtained a rare foreign liquor;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a very sweet wine meant for highborn ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nylon, perform the poison tasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm the one who has to drink it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, gulp it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll drink it, I'm drinking it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My Queen here have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I get out of this forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you lost, young one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the man-eating wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a huge, magical wolf that's been alive for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.36,0:17:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one way to protect yourself from that wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a house up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go there quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, the drug mixed into that sake will take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Ladyship will start babbling away—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is a girl, she's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll start babbling too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you drank that sake as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so dusty in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.01,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wolf footprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the wolf's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that wolf lures all travelers into this house and eats them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, those are all hats from the people who got eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we possibly beat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they say wolves have a soft spot for girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me to dress like a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.43,0:19:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to win unless you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in their right mind would dress like a girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! There, this will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You look super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, take this off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak more like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you strip me, I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the wolf close and suddenly attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine is taking effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My chest...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong, my Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,, Grand Duke, I have something to confess to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Little Red Riding Hood...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm weakened over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that tastes worse than eating a child who's trembling in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.91,0:21:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll eat you up gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trembling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, what am I supposed to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were much smaller, I wouldn't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this size?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even smaller?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this, size?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.62,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You put up a good fight, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It is! It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good! Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My chest hurts, it feels like something is stuck inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that won't do, it's bad for your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please open up and confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, it's about Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.51,0:23:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.20,0:23:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,actually?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy! I'm gonna talk, all right all right, I'm gonna talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That chatter potion we got from the apothecary works really well, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Grand Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Drugging the Queen to make her spill the beans on Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a mastermind like me could pull that off—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.34,0:23:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.43,0:23:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Lord Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, Duralumin is trying to find out from the Queen whether you're a boy or a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.79,0:23:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.55,0:23:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, what are you doing to my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to have intruded, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.05,0:23:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you are a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are too many evil schemes and customs in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.21,0:24:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that is gone, I am a boy, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.95,0:24:42.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:45.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
